#. translators: 1: name, 2: domain, 3: score, 4-6: priorities, 7: offer, 8:
#. estimate.
#: includes/class-elwhc-admin.php:558
msgid ""
"Hello %1$s,\n"
"\n"
"I have completed the quick diagnostic for your site: %2$s\n"
"\n"
"Score: %3$d/100\n"
"\n"
"The 3 priorities are:\n"
"1. %4$s\n"
"2. %5$s\n"
"3. %6$s\n"
"\n"
"Recommended intervention: %7$s\n"
"Indicative estimate: %8$s\n"
"\n"
"The exact price will depend on WordPress/hosting access and the real condition of the site. If you want, I can suggest the next step."
msgstr ""
"Hola %1$s:\n"
"\n"
"He completado el diagnóstico rápido de su sitio: %2$s\n"
"\n"
"Puntuación: %3$d/100\n"
"\n"
"Las 3 prioridades son:\n"
"1. %4$s\n"
"2. %5$s\n"
"3. %6$s\n"
"\n"
"Intervención recomendada: %7$s\n"
"Estimación orientativa: %8$s\n"
"\n"
"El precio exacto dependerá del acceso a WordPress y al alojamiento, y del estado real del sitio. Si lo desea, puedo proponerle el siguiente paso."

#. translators: 1: name, 2: domain, 3: score, 4-6: priorities, 7: offer, 8:
#. estimate.
#: includes/class-elwhc-admin.php:571
msgid ""
"Hello %1$s,\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for using our website health check. I have reviewed the quick diagnostic for %2$s and wanted to share a short summary.\n"
"\n"
"Overall score: %3$d/100\n"
"\n"
"The three points I would prioritise:\n"
"1. %4$s\n"
"2. %5$s\n"
"3. %6$s\n"
"\n"
"Based on this, I would suggest: %7$s\n"
"Indicative estimate: %8$s\n"
"\n"
"This figure is only a guide — the exact price depends on access to WordPress and hosting, the number of plugins, and the real condition of the site. I would be happy to arrange a short call to walk you through the details.\n"
"\n"
"Kind regards"
msgstr ""
"Hola %1$s:\n"
"\n"
"Gracias por utilizar nuestro análisis de salud del sitio web. He revisado el diagnóstico rápido de %2$s y quería compartir un breve resumen.\n"
"\n"
"Puntuación global: %3$d/100\n"
"\n"
"Los tres puntos que priorizaría:\n"
"1. %4$s\n"
"2. %5$s\n"
"3. %6$s\n"
"\n"
"En función de esto, le sugeriría: %7$s\n"
"Estimación orientativa: %8$s\n"
"\n"
"Esta cifra es solo una referencia: el precio exacto depende del acceso a WordPress y al alojamiento, del número de plugins y del estado real del sitio. Con gusto organizaré una breve llamada para explicarle los detalles.\n"
"\n"
"Un cordial saludo"

